b-stops:list 36.0pt;\"><strong>Lasts over 5 years</strong>, washable and reusable</li><li style=\"mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;\"><strong>Cleans in half the time</strong>, with no streaks or lint</li><li style=\"mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;\">Helps people <strong>save time, effort, and money</strong></li><li style=\"mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;\"><strong>100% Made in Italy</strong> — artisanal quality, time-tested</li></ul><div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" noshade=\"\" style=\"color:black;\" align=\"center\"></div><p><strong>• Payment Terms:</strong><br>Earn&nbsp;<strong>up to 25% commission per sale</strong>, with additional performance bonuses.<br>Payouts are sent <strong>monthly via PayPal or bank transfer</strong> — on time, every time.</p><div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><hr size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" noshade=\"\" style=\"color:black;\" align=\"center\"></div><p><strong>• Other Benefits for Affiliates:</strong></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;\" type=\"disc\"><li style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;\">Your own <strong>trackable, personalized affiliate code</strong></li><li style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;\">A full kit of <strong>ready-to-use content</strong>: images, videos, captions</li><li style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;\">Access to <strong>seasonal campaigns and exclusive challenges</strong></li><li style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;\"><strong>Direct support</strong> via chat, plus regular updates and guidance</li></ul><p>Whether you’re a content creator, influencer, or simply passionate about clean living, Supercloth gives you a <strong>trusted, high-converting product</strong> to share — with real rewards.</p><p><br></p></div>",
